    "what_en": "Claude handles non-animation creative direction for HyperFrames videos: it reads a design spec (frame.md / design.md) as brand truth, then decides palettes, typography, narration, beat planning, audio-reactive visuals and composition.",
    "when_en": "Triggered when a project has a design spec to follow, or when you need visual direction, palettes, typography, pacing or narration. Atomic motion and scene blueprints go to hyperframes-animation.",
    "say_en": [
      {
        "text": "Give me a palette from the brand colors and fonts in frame.md",
        "note": "It reads the spec before choosing colors."
